```C++
int internal_change;
int condition;
while (internal_change < condition){
	statement1;
	statement2;
	...;
	internal_change ++;
}
```
No internal change will result in an [[Infinite loop]]

```c++
int counter=1;
int i = 0;
while (i < 10){
	cout << "i is: " << i;
	i ++;
	counter ++;
}
```
